msgid ""
"The result of the pathfinding can be influenced with the following "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"El resultado del pathfinding se puede influenciar con las siguientes "
"propiedades."

msgid ""
"The ``get_next_path_position()`` function is responsible for updating many "
"of the agent's internal states and properties. The function should be "
"repeatedly called *once* every ``physics_process`` until "
"``is_navigation_finished()`` tells that the path is finished. The function "
"should not be called after the target position or path end has been reached "
"as it can make the agent jitter in place due to the repeated path updates. "
"Always check very early in script with ``is_navigation_finished()`` if the "
"path is already finished."
msgstr ""
"La función ``get_next_path_position()`` es responsable por actualizar muchos "
"de los estados internos y propiedades de los agentes. La función deberá "
"repetirse *una vez* cada ``physics_process`` hasta que "
"``is_navigation_finished()`` diga que la ruta terminó. La función no se "
"debería llamar después de alcanzar la posición o ruta meta, ya que puede "
"hacer al agente traquetear en su lugar debido a las actualizaciones de ruta "
"constantes. Siempre verifica temprano en el script con "
"``is_navigation_finished()`` si la ruta ya terminó."

msgid "Pathfollowing common problems"
msgstr "Problemas comunes de pathfollowing"
